    "detailed_description": "Coloring by numbers game for relaxation.<br>This coloring book is a guarantee of good mood.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061760/extras/05913d19eaf41f91e92c6d031bddfee5.poster.avif?t=1751293017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061760/extras/05913d19eaf41f91e92c6d031bddfee5.webm?t=1751293017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061760/extras/05913d19eaf41f91e92c6d031bddfee5.mp4?t=1751293017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In it you can find all kinds of pictures for every taste.<br>Coloring by numbers with Colorizing is a calming and easy activity for people of all ages. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061760/extras/bda42c88d495d4748451d478bd424ddb.poster.avif?t=1751293017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061760/extras/bda42c88d495d4748451d478bd424ddb.webm?t=1751293017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061760/extras/bda42c88d495d4748451d478bd424ddb.mp4?t=1751293017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This drawing game is suitable for children and adults, everyone can enjoy pixel coloring.<br>You will definitely love coloring with this beautiful coloring book!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061760/extras/24218727159d9e181963ddca5e622013.poster.avif?t=1751293017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akam